From 75d0f2d247bffdcc092a9d6e03a60ccf92444c49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matterward Labs <admin@matterwardlabs.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:48:44 +0530
Subject: report DOM mutations to the embedder

content::RenderFrameObserver has no DOM-mutation callback at this
milestone, so the page-intelligence endpoint advanced its graph only on
scroll, focus and layout-shift signals: an appendChild produced no delta at
all, and node removal had no production caller. MutationObserver::Delegate
is declared in blink's renderer core and reachable only from inside it, so
the observer cannot live in the overlay. Three downstream-owned files
export a minimal WebDomMutationObserver behind blink's public web API,
modelled on web_form_element_observer_impl.cc, and two build-list lines
register them. No existing upstream source line changes.

Rebase risk: low. New files plus two sorted-list entries.

Needed by: WP-M2-05.
Retirement: permanent while page intelligence exists, or until upstream
exposes an equivalent observer.

Taffy-Patch: 0026

